# Archivierungs- und Lösch-Tests für Wishling API

@baseUrl = https://wishling.ddev.site

### Create Test Wish for Deletion
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists/{{wishlistHash}}/wishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Test Wish zum Löschen",
    "description": "Dieser Wunsch wird zu Testzwecken gelöscht",
    "url": "https://example.com/delete-test",
    "price": "15.99"
}

### Archive Wish (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists/{{wishlistHash}}/wishes/{{wishHash}}/archive
Content-Type: application/json

### Unarchive Wish (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists/{{wishlistHash}}/wishes/{{wishHash}}/unarchive
Content-Type: application/json

### Archive Wish via PUT
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists/{{wishlistHash}}/wishes/{{wishHash}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "archived": true
}

### Unarchive Wish via PUT
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists/{{wishlistHash}}/wishes/{{wishHash}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "archived": false
}

### Delete Wish (PERMANENT)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists/{{wishlistHash}}/wishes/{{wishHash}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Active Wishes (default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists/{{wishlistHash}}/wishes
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Archived Wishes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists/{{wishlistHash}}/wishes?archived=true
Content-Type: application/json

### Get All Active Wishes (explicit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists/{{wishlistHash}}/wishes?archived=false
Content-Type: application/json

### Update Wish and Archive simultaneously
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists/{{wishlistHash}}/wishes/{{wishHash}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Erfüllter Wunsch",
    "description": "Dieser Wunsch wurde erfüllt",
    "archived": true
}

### Complete Workflow Test (Create → Update → Archive → Unarchive → Delete)

# 1. Create a new wish
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists/{{wishlistHash}}/wishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Workflow Test Wish",
    "description": "Für kompletten Workflow-Test",
    "url": "https://example.com/workflow",
    "price": "99.99"
}

# 2. Update the wish (use hash from step 1)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists/{{wishlistHash}}/wishes/WISH_HASH_FROM_STEP_1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Updated Workflow Wish",
    "price": "79.99"
}

# 3. Archive the wish
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists/{{wishlistHash}}/wishes/WISH_HASH_FROM_STEP_1/archive

# 4. Unarchive the wish
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists/{{wishlistHash}}/wishes/WISH_HASH_FROM_STEP_1/unarchive

# 5. Delete the wish permanently
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlist/wishlists/{{wishlistHash}}/wishes/WISH_HASH_FROM_STEP_1
